    {
      "text": "Figure 2(a): Recall@5 on the LANGUAGE ablation. Four bars per team — de all-subjects (blue), en all-subjects (red), de tib-core (yellow), en tib-core (green) — over the same fourteen teams in alphabetical order, y-axis 0 to 0.6, each bar labelled with its value. DUTIR831 is highest on en tib-core at 0.510 and Annif close behind at 0.502; RUC Team reads 0.447 / 0.421 / 0.494 / 0.461. Several teams submitted for only part of the grid: DNB-AI-Project and Jim have no tib-core bars, Homa and last_minute no all-subjects bars, NBF no tib-core bars. The lowest non-empty values are TSOTSALAB at 0.034 (en tib-core) and last_minute at 0.048. Some printed labels overlap their neighbours and are only partly legible; the ones quoted here are the ones that are not occluded.",
